APPLICATION ON BEHALF OF THE {APPLICANT_OR_APPLICANT_DESCRIPTION} SEEKING: BAIL APPLICATION

MOST RESPECTFULLY SHOWETH:

1. That the above-captioned matter is pending before this Hon’ble Court and the Applicant’s particulars and role in the proceedings are {APPLICANT_ROLE_AND_RELEVANT_DETAILS}.

2. That the material facts and procedural history relevant to this application are as follows: {MATERIAL_FACTS_AND_PROCEDURAL_HISTORY}.

3. That the present application is made under {APPLICABLE_PROVISION_OR_RULE}, as applicable to the proceeding and the date/event in question. The Applicant respectfully submits the following grounds:

1. The Applicant is in custody since {{DATE_OF_ARREST}} and the investigation/trial status is {{INVESTIGATION_OR_TRIAL_STATUS}}.
2. The Applicant undertakes to attend proceedings, cooperate with the investigation and comply with every lawful condition imposed by the Court.
3. The Applicant submits that the relevant individual circumstances supporting release are: {{CASE_SPECIFIC_BAIL_GROUNDS}}.

4. That the documents relied upon in support of this application are listed in Schedule A / annexed as Annexures {ANNEXURE_IDENTIFIERS}, and copies have been or will be served as required by applicable procedure.

5. That this application is made bona fide for the ends of justice and not to delay the proceedings or cause unfair prejudice to any party.

PRAYER

In view of the facts and grounds stated above, it is most respectfully prayed that this Hon’ble Court may be pleased to:

(a) Release the Applicant on bail in {{FIR_OR_CASE_NUMBER}}, subject to such lawful conditions as this Hon’ble Court considers appropriate.
(b) Pass any other order(s) that this Hon’ble Court may deem fit and proper in the facts and circumstances of the case.

AND FOR THIS ACT OF KINDNESS, THE APPLICANT AS IN DUTY BOUND SHALL EVER PRAY.

Place: {PLACE}
Date: {DATE}

{NAME_OF_ADVOCATE}
Advocate for the Applicant
Enrollment No.: {ADVOCATE_ENROLMENT_NUMBER}

{APPLICANT_SIGNATURE_OR_AUTHORISED_SIGNATORY}

