I, {VERIFIER_NAME}, {VERIFIER_DESCRIPTION}, the Applicant/authorised representative in the above matter, do hereby verify that the contents of paragraphs {PARAGRAPHS_BASED_ON_PERSONAL_KNOWLEDGE} are true to my personal knowledge and those of paragraphs {PARAGRAPHS_BASED_ON_RECORD_OR_INFORMATION} are based on records/information believed to be true. No material fact has knowingly been concealed.

Verified at {PLACE} on {DATE}.

